{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0690_musashi_01",
      "hash": "d74771d1dcdd62f4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏「我們為了阪木老大\\n大老遠跑到紫苑鎮來……"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0690_musashi_02",
      "hash": "d74774d1dcdd680d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "結果卻到處都找不到\\n那個叫富士的老頭子！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0690_kojiro_01",
      "hash": "c6bc31c54cc29f90",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小次郎「還沒找的地方就只剩下\\n寶可夢塔的最上面了吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0690_musashi_03",
      "hash": "d74773d1dcdd665a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏「可是有奇怪的[VAR COLOR(0006)]幽靈[VAR COLOR(0000)]在搗蛋，\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]沒辦法到上面去[VAR COLOR(0000)]啊～"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0690_kojiro_02",
      "hash": "c6bc34c54cc2a4a9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小次郎「既然找不到\\n那個老頭子……\\c\\n那我們至少把這隻卡拉卡拉\\n捉回基地去吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0690_musashi_04",
      "hash": "d7476ed1dcdd5ddb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏「好主意！那我們出發\\n去[VAR COLOR(0006)]玉虹市[VAR COLOR(0000)]的[VAR COLOR(0006)]火箭遊戲城[VAR COLOR(0000)]吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0690_karakara_01",
      "hash": "8ac4c1eac38e8eb8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "卡拉卡拉「馬麻～？"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0690_musashi_08",
      "hash": "d7476ad1dcdd570f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏「乖哦乖哦！\\n你的媽媽就在玉虹市喔～\\r\\n我們帶你去吧～"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0690_karakara_02",
      "hash": "8ac4c4eac38e93d1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "卡拉卡拉「馬麻馬麻！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0690_all_01",
      "hash": "afaa9eb286d542b1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "既然這麼決定了，\\n那就趕快走吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0690_young_m_01",
      "hash": "9bacda0fa316a5ac",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我、我看到可怕的事了……"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0690_young_m_02",
      "hash": "9bacdd0fa316aac5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳看到沒！？\\n火箭隊把卡拉卡拉拐走了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0690_young_m_03",
      "hash": "9bacdc0fa316a912",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "他們好像是要去\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]玉虹市[VAR COLOR(0000)]的樣子……"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0690_young_m_04",
      "hash": "9bacd70fa316a093",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "搞不好是打算把牠的\\n骨頭拿來高價出售呢……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0690_young_m_05",
      "hash": "9bacd60fa3169ee0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳從火箭隊手裡\\n救出了卡拉卡拉嗎！？\\r\\n好厲害啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0690_young_m_06",
      "hash": "9bacd90fa316a3f9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這是我一點感謝的心意！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main0690_system_01",
      "hash": "097ca861ce11115b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]得到了\\n20個超級球！"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main0690_young_m_07",
      "hash": "9bacd80fa316a246",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要是能像[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一樣勇敢，\\c\\n不知道我是不是也能\\n面不改色地爬上寶可夢塔。"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main0690_musashi_05",
      "hash": "d7476dd1dcdd5c28",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏「去吧！就是那邊！\\n啊～！就只差一點點了說！"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main0690_kojiro_03",
      "hash": "c6bc33c54cc2a2f6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小次郎「哎，武藏啊～\\c\\n我們也差不多該回基地了吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main0690_musashi_06",
      "hash": "d74770d1dcdd6141",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏「哎呦～有什麼關係嘛～！\\c\\n反正已經把[VAR COLOR(0006)]卡拉卡拉[VAR COLOR(0000)]交給守衛了，\\n休息一下也不會怎樣嘛！\\c\\n是說，[VAR COLOR(0006)]基地的暗門[VAR COLOR(0000)]\\n是要怎麼開來著？"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_main0690_kojiro_04",
      "hash": "c6bc36c54cc2a80f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小次郎「不就是去調查\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]交通工具[VAR COLOR(0000)]的[VAR COLOR(0006)]海報[VAR COLOR(0000)]嗎！\\c\\n就是那張[VAR COLOR(0006)]跟我們一樣風格[VAR COLOR(0000)]，\\n帥氣十足的[VAR COLOR(0006)]交通工具[VAR COLOR(0000)]的海報啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_main0690_musashi_07",
      "hash": "d7476fd1dcdd5f8e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏「跟我們一樣風格的\\n交通工具是什麼東西啊？"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_main0690_kojiro_05",
      "hash": "c6bc35c54cc2a65c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小次郎「那還用說嗎？\\n當然是[VAR COLOR(0006)]穿梭在銀河[VAR COLOR(0000)]……的那個啦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_main0690_nyasu_01",
      "hash": "299ff18c5c968898",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "喵喵「呼喵～～"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0690_max",
      "hash": "2dbbf705c3cc63fc"
    }
  ]
}
